1
00:00:00,593 --> 00:00:01,423
晚安 宝贝
Good night, sweatpea.

2
00:00:01,753 --> 00:00:02,913
晚安 亲爱的
Good night, honey.

3
00:00:06,753 --> 00:00:07,263
米奇尔
Mitchell!

4
00:00:07,263 --> 00:00:08,803
咱们的热水浴缸里有个陌生人
There's a stranger in our hot tub!

5
00:00:08,803 --> 00:00:10,074
是谁
Who is it?!

6
00:00:10,104 --> 00:00:12,244
你知道陌生人是什么意思吧
You do know what "stranger" means, don't you?

7
00:00:12,274 --> 00:00:13,574
天啊 我的天啊
Oh, my g -- oh, my god!

8
00:00:13,614 --> 00:00:15,144
他在那儿多久了
How long has he been there?

9
00:00:15,174 --> 00:00:17,244
我在你看到他的前一秒才看到他
I saw him exactly one second before you.

10
00:00:17,274 --> 00:00:18,644
咱俩知道的一样多
You know everything I know.

11
00:00:18,684 --> 00:00:19,984
好吧 我去报警
Okay, I'm -- I'm calling 911.

12
00:00:20,014 --> 00:00:21,514
我去拿我的球棒
I'm getting my bat.

13
00:00:24,554 --> 00:00:25,855
或许我们反应过度了
Maybe we're overreacting.

14
00:00:25,885 --> 00:00:26,855
是啊 他或许有个很好的理由
Yeah, he could have a very good reason for be --

15
00:00:26,885 --> 00:00:27,885
我们至少应该去打个招呼
We should at least say hello.

16
00:00:27,925 --> 00:00:28,995
只是出于礼貌
It's only polite.

17
00:00:29,025 --> 00:00:30,525
好的
Okay.

18
00:00:42,956 --> 00:00:44,886
于是我死死地盯住那只土狼
So I looked that coyote dead in the eye,

19
00:00:44,886 --> 00:00:47,616
我一句话都没说 就让它明白了
and I let him know, without saying a word,

20
00:00:47,656 --> 00:00:49,926
我不会伤害你的
"I will not harm you...

21
00:00:49,956 --> 00:00:51,686
但是我才是这里的老大
but I'm the alpha here".

22
00:00:51,726 --> 00:00:54,156
而它也紧紧地盯着我
And he just stared back at me...

23
00:00:54,196 --> 00:00:55,927
完全被我迷惑住了
mesmerized.

24
00:00:59,237 --> 00:01:00,647
太神奇了
Amazing.

25
00:01:00,647 --> 00:01:04,087
原来 贝瑞刚搬进我们楼上的公寓
Turns out, Barry just moved into the apartment upstairs

26
00:01:04,087 --> 00:01:06,187
他以为这个热水浴盆是全楼公用的
and thought the hot tub was for the whole building.

27
00:01:06,227 --> 00:01:08,757
总而言之 他酷呆了 而且他是直男
Anyway, he's a super-cool guy, and he's straight,

28
00:01:08,797 --> 00:01:10,528
所以没什么好尴尬的
so there's no weirdness.

29
00:01:10,568 --> 00:01:12,998
除了你变成了个十六岁的小姑娘
Aside from you turning into a 16-year-old girl.

30
00:01:13,038 --> 00:01:14,038
我才没呢
I did not.

31
00:01:16,368 --> 00:01:17,368
卡梅隆 把你的手臂给我
Cameron, give me your arm.

32
00:01:17,408 --> 00:01:18,708
好
Okay.

33
00:01:22,478 --> 00:01:23,978
你在做什么
What cha doin'?

34
00:01:24,008 --> 00:01:26,149
我正在学做一名灵气按摩师
Oh, I'm studying to be a reiki master.

35
00:01:26,179 --> 00:01:28,819
我正在把我的正面能量
What I'm doing is I'm transferring my positive energy

36
00:01:28,819 --> 00:01:29,739
传给卡梅隆
into Cameron,

37
00:01:30,009 --> 00:01:31,409
并把他所有的消极能量弄出来
and I'm taking out all the negative energy.

38
00:01:31,449 --> 00:01:32,479
好的
Okay.

39
00:01:32,509 --> 00:01:34,249
-你感觉到了吗 -感觉到了
- Now, do you feel that? - I do.

40
00:01:34,249 --> 00:01:35,219
感觉很温暖吗
Does it feel warm?

41
00:01:35,249 --> 00:01:35,969
确实很温暖
It does.

42
00:01:35,969 --> 00:01:37,769
真的很温暖 米奇尔
It feels warm, Mitchell.

43
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:40,000
当然暖了 我们可是在泡热水浴呀
Imagine that. In a hot tub.

44
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,960
他开车经过时你准备干吗
What are you gonna do when he drives by?

45
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:44,890
我要叫他减速
I'm gonna tell him to slow down.

46
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:47,390
我认为你应该把他从车里拖出来
I think you should drag him out of his car,

47
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:49,190
然后我们轮流捶他的胃
and we all get turns punching him in the stomach

48
00:01:49,230 --> 00:01:50,500
捶到他吐
until he barfs.

49
00:01:50,530 --> 00:01:52,370
宝贝儿 我想我只会把他的车牌号
Honey, I think I'm just gonna turn over his license plate

50
00:01:52,370 --> 00:01:53,360
交给警察而已
to the police.

51
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:54,790
拜托
Please.

52
00:01:54,830 --> 00:01:56,731
叫个披萨再打给警察
Order a pizza and call the cops.

53
00:01:56,771 --> 00:01:58,571
看谁到的快点
We'll see who gets here first.

54
00:01:58,601 --> 00:02:01,311
自从他们在奥克蒙特设了减速坎
Ever since they put those speed bumps on Oakmont,

55
00:02:01,341 --> 00:02:04,421
一些驾驶疯狂跑车的司机
some lunatic driver in a crazy sports car

56
00:02:04,421 --> 00:02:05,851
就开始在我们这条街上赛车
has been racing down our street,

57
00:02:05,851 --> 00:02:07,081
这太危险了
and it is dangerous.

58
00:02:07,121 --> 00:02:09,421
我们这里有小孩 还坐婴儿车的婴儿
We've got kids here and babies in strollers

59
00:02:09,451 --> 00:02:10,822
还有喜欢慢跑的妈妈们
and moms who like to jog.

60
00:02:10,852 --> 00:02:12,652
她必须每天跑步 不然会疯掉的
She has to run every day, or she goes crazy.

61
00:02:12,692 --> 00:02:14,122
她就像一条边境牧羊犬
She's like a border collie.

62
00:02:14,192 --> 00:02:16,492
你把我比作一条狗吗
You're comparing me to a dog?

63
00:02:16,532 --> 00:02:19,232
那可是世界上最聪明的狗
The smartest dogs in the world.

64
00:02:23,582 --> 00:02:24,912
你们在干什么呢
What are you guys doing?

65
00:02:24,952 --> 00:02:26,083
做那些警察不肯做的
What the cops won't.

66
00:02:26,113 --> 00:02:27,853
我们在抓那些违章超速驾驶者
We are catching that speeder,

67
00:02:27,883 --> 00:02:30,253
等我们抓到他时 他满耳都会听到这个
and when we do, he's gonna get an earful of this.

68
00:02:30,283 --> 00:02:31,913
开慢点 混蛋
Slow down, jerk!

69
00:02:31,913 --> 00:02:32,603
好了 别激动
Oh! Okay! Easy.

70
00:02:32,603 --> 00:02:33,533
我的天啊 妈 你在干吗
Oh, my god. Mom, what are you doing?

71
00:02:33,533 --> 00:02:35,033
你干吗这么变态
Why are you being such a freak?!

72
00:02:35,073 --> 00:02:36,473
我是出于安全考虑才这么变态的
I am being a freak for safety.

73
00:02:36,503 --> 00:02:37,803
而且我这么做都是为了你们
And I'm doing this for you,

74
00:02:37,843 --> 00:02:39,843
因为我不希望你们发生任何不幸
because I don't want anything bad to happen to you.

75
00:02:39,873 --> 00:02:41,174
这太丢人了
Well, it's embarrassing.

76
00:02:41,214 --> 00:02:42,374
妈 你得找点事干了
Mom, you need a life.

77
00:02:42,414 --> 00:02:44,714
你为什么就不能在博物馆里做做自愿者
Why can't you just volunteer at the museum

78
00:02:44,744 --> 00:02:46,554
或者给那些老人送送布丁呢
or bring pudding to old people?

79
00:02:46,584 --> 00:02:48,134
宝贝儿 要是说有谁丢人的话
Honey, if anybody's being embarrassing right now,

80
00:02:48,134 --> 00:02:48,754
那个人就是你
it's you.

81
00:02:48,784 --> 00:02:51,484
卢克 我是你老爸
Luke, I am your father!

82
00:02:51,524 --> 00:02:53,824
这让我想起了在产房的时候
That takes me back to the delivery room.

83
00:02:53,824 --> 00:02:55,125
当你从你妈的私处钻出来时
That's what I said to you

84
00:02:55,165 --> 00:02:56,865
我就是这么跟你说的
when you were coming out of your mom's lady parts.

85
00:02:56,895 --> 00:02:58,725
天啊 老爸
Oh, my god, dad!

86
00:02:58,765 --> 00:03:00,435
我的天 我认识那俩女生
Oh, my god. I know those girls.

87
00:03:00,465 --> 00:03:02,435
- 怎么了 你觉得我们丢人吗 - 是的
- What? Are you ashamed of us? - Yes!

88
00:03:02,465 --> 00:03:04,165
《甜蜜高谷》咯
Ooh. Sweet Valley High!

89
00:03:04,205 --> 00:03:06,525
是那个住在第七街的女人打来的
This is that woman from the house on seventh street!

90
00:03:06,535 --> 00:03:06,945
好极了
Oh, good!

91
00:03:06,945 --> 00:03:08,605
是啊 如果我在下个月底前把房子卖出去
Yeah, if I sell it by the end of next month,

92
00:03:08,645 --> 00:03:10,996
我就能打败盖尔·索普 成为季度最佳销售员了
I dethrone Gil Thorpe as salesman of the quarter.

93
00:03:10,996 --> 00:03:12,796
太棒了 爸
That's awesome, dad.

94
00:03:12,796 --> 00:03:13,616
确实棒极了
It is awesome.

95
00:03:14,856 --> 00:03:15,526
我是菲尔·邓菲
Phil Dunphy.

96
00:03:15,526 --> 00:03:16,966
超速驾驶的家伙来了 超速驾驶的家伙来了
That's the speeder! That's the speeder!

97
00:03:16,996 --> 00:03:19,026
开慢点 混蛋 开慢点
Slow down, jerk! Slow down!

98
00:03:19,026 --> 00:03:20,626
是的 不 是的 这太好了
Yeah. No. Yeah, that's great.

99
00:03:20,656 --> 00:03:22,096
好的 尽管问
Okay, fire away.

100
00:03:22,126 --> 00:03:23,996
-2urn801 -好的 给我地址就行
- 2-u-r-n-8-0-1. - Yeah. Oh, uh, just the address.

101
00:03:24,026 --> 00:03:25,927
-好的 一 零 -801 2urn 笔呢
- Yep. Okay. 1-0... - 8-0-1. 2-u-r-n. A pen.

102
00:03:25,967 --> 00:03:27,427
-一 北边 第七 -我给爸了
- 1...North...Seventh... - I gave it to dad.

103
00:03:29,537 --> 00:03:30,867
-ur -街
- U-r... - ...Street.

104
00:03:30,897 --> 00:03:32,037
-我的天 -好的 10-4
- Oh, god. - Okay. 10-4.

105
00:03:32,067 --> 00:03:35,207
这将是我自2006年以来我最走运的一年
This is gonna be my best year since 2006.

106
00:03:36,837 --> 00:03:39,377
走吧 孩子 该送你去学校了
Let's go, kid. Back to the salt mine.

107
00:03:39,407 --> 00:03:41,548
不用了 杰 我今天骑自行车去上学
That's okay, Jay. I'm biking to school today.

108
00:03:41,608 --> 00:03:42,118
你真行
Good for you.

109
00:03:42,118 --> 00:03:43,358
学校里有一群很酷的小孩
There's a bunch of cool kids

110
00:03:43,358 --> 00:03:44,468
每天都骑自行车上学
who ride their bikes every day.

111
00:03:44,468 --> 00:03:45,568
我也想骑
Thought I'd join them.

112
00:03:46,288 --> 00:03:48,188
等等 等等 等等 等等
Hey, wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

113
00:03:48,218 --> 00:03:49,588
那是什么鬼东西
What the hell is that?

114
00:03:49,618 --> 00:03:52,128
我的新自行车 妈妈昨天给我买的
My new bike. Mom got it for me yesterday.

115
00:03:52,158 --> 00:03:53,228
很周到吧
Pretty sweet, huh?

116
00:03:53,258 --> 00:03:54,528
辅助轮
Training wheels?

117
00:03:54,558 --> 00:03:56,009
质量很好的 还是订做的
Nice ones. Custom made.

118
00:03:56,009 --> 00:03:57,749
这种型号的自行车一般都不配辅助轮的
They don't usually come on bikes this size.

119
00:03:57,779 --> 00:03:59,369
-歌洛莉亚 -怎么了
- Gloria! - What's wrong?

120
00:03:59,369 --> 00:04:00,339
你不会骑自行车吗
You don't know how to ride a bike?

121
00:04:00,369 --> 00:04:01,639
我会骑这辆自行车
I know how to ride this bike.

122
00:04:01,669 --> 00:04:04,069
这辆车连斯蒂芬·霍金[肌肉萎缩的物理学家]都会骑
Stephen Hawking could ride that bike.

123
00:04:04,989 --> 00:04:06,489
我来了 怎么了
Ay. What happened?

124
00:04:06,519 --> 00:04:07,489
他摔倒了吗
Did he fall?

125
00:04:07,519 --> 00:04:08,919
怎么可能摔倒
How could he fall?

126
00:04:08,959 --> 00:04:09,629
你不能让他骑
You can't send him to school

127
00:04:09,629 --> 00:04:10,860
带辅助轮的自行车去上学
on a bike with training wheels.

128
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:11,910
同学们会笑他的
They'll make fun of him.

129
00:04:11,910 --> 00:04:13,570
你没有教他怎么骑自行车吗
Didn't you teach him how to ride a bike?

130
00:04:13,570 --> 00:04:15,430
怎么教 我自己都不会骑自行车
How could I? I don't know how to ride a bike.

131
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:16,750
十亿中国人都会做的事
2/3 of my house can't do

132
00:04:16,750 --> 00:04:18,070
我们家居然有三分之二的人都不会
what a billion Chinese do.

133
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:20,440
我妈觉得骑自行车很危险
My mother thought that riding a bike was dangerous.

134
00:04:20,470 --> 00:04:22,610
她会说 "别人就会这样把你抓走的"
She would say, "that's how people grab you"!

135
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:24,140
好吧 这样好了
Okay, this is how it's going down.

136
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:25,641
今天 我开车带你去学校
Today I'm driving you to school,

137
00:04:25,671 --> 00:04:27,441
周末 我也给你买辆自行车
on the weekend, I'm buying you a bike,

138
00:04:27,471 --> 00:04:28,911
我来教你们俩骑车
and I'm teaching both of you.

139
00:04:28,941 --> 00:04:29,911
我很紧张
I'm nervous...

140
00:04:29,941 --> 00:04:31,111
但也很兴奋
but I'm excited.

141
00:04:31,141 --> 00:04:33,231
你们俩个去玩吧 我就免了
You two have fun. I pass.

142
00:04:33,231 --> 00:04:34,431
这根本不合理
It makes no sense.

143
00:04:34,461 --> 00:04:37,031
那个东西怎么可能立得住
There's no reason that thing should stay upright.

144
00:04:37,071 --> 00:04:38,131
你也不可能立得住
There's no reason you should stay upright,

145
00:04:38,171 --> 00:04:38,901
但事实就是可以
but it just works.

146
00:04:42,712 --> 00:04:44,812
菲尔 快进来
Hey, Phil. Come on in.

147
00:04:44,842 --> 00:04:46,382
劳拉 你好呀
Laura, good day.

148
00:04:46,382 --> 00:04:48,892
我超喜欢门口的设计
Well, I couldn't love this entry any more.

149
00:04:48,922 --> 00:04:50,402
很有家的感觉
It's very welcoming.

150
00:04:50,402 --> 00:04:51,502
我十分钟后还有点事要办
Yeah, I got a thing in 10 minutes,

151
00:04:51,542 --> 00:04:53,302
-所以我要快点搞掂这件事 -没问题
- so I have to make this quick. - Great.

152
00:04:53,302 --> 00:04:55,202
让我给你介绍一下
Um, let me run through

153
00:04:55,202 --> 00:04:57,143
我的销售三策略
my three-pronged approach to selling --

154
00:04:57,173 --> 00:04:58,793
我只需要一个策略 那就是把房子卖出去
I only need one prong -- sell the house.

155
00:04:58,793 --> 00:04:59,883
我不想跟那个女的一样
I don't want to be that yutz

156
00:04:59,883 --> 00:05:01,053
把房子的价位定的太高
who prices her house too high

157
00:05:01,083 --> 00:05:02,653
结果一整年都卖不出去
so it sits around for a year

158
00:05:02,653 --> 00:05:05,613
而那些在星期天无所事事的人
while every lookie-loo without something to do on Sundays

159
00:05:05,613 --> 00:05:07,013
都跑来看我的房子 窥探我的隐私
is going through my underwear drawer.

160
00:05:07,053 --> 00:05:08,073
佣金是多少
What's the number?

161
00:05:08,073 --> 00:05:09,303
我们需要考虑几个因素
Well, there are quite a few factors to take into --

162
00:05:09,343 --> 00:05:10,844
我只要一个数字
Need a number.

163
00:05:10,874 --> 00:05:12,724
我们规定的佣金是百分之一点四
Uh, we list at 1.4.

164
00:05:12,724 --> 00:05:14,084
底线是百分之一点二五
We take anything north of 1.25.

165
00:05:14,114 --> 00:05:15,714
成交
Done!

166
00:05:15,754 --> 00:05:17,154
好极了
Great!

167
00:05:17,424 --> 00:05:19,274
我文件都准备好了 现在就能签
I got all the paperwork right here.

168
00:05:19,274 --> 00:05:20,804
别急 想要跟我进一步发展
Whoa, whoa, whoa. You got to buy me a beer

169
00:05:20,804 --> 00:05:22,804
怎么也得先把我灌醉才行
before you can put your hand up my sweater.

170
00:05:22,994 --> 00:05:24,474
我可没有那种冒犯之意
Oh, I had no intention --

171
00:05:24,474 --> 00:05:26,305
要是这周末开放日举行的成功
Put on a great open house this weekend,

172
00:05:26,305 --> 00:05:27,905
零头就都是你的
the listing's yours.

173
00:05:29,475 --> 00:05:30,385
放马过来吧 劳拉
Bring it, Laura.

174
00:05:30,385 --> 00:05:32,805
想要考验我 我可是久经考验的
You want to test me? I've been tested my whole life.

175
00:05:33,415 --> 00:05:35,125
别人到头来怎么输的都不知道
They could never find anything.

176
00:05:36,175 --> 00:05:38,735
那么星期天中午十二点到下午四点来举行开放日如何
So, uh, Sunday 12:00 to 4:00 for the open house?

177
00:05:38,735 --> 00:05:40,115
-这时间合适吗 -很好
- That works for you? - Great.

178
00:05:40,205 --> 00:05:42,176
好的 如果你还有什么问题
Great. Oh, and if you have any questions

179
00:05:42,176 --> 00:05:43,446
或是什么需要 打我电话就行了
or you need anything, just call.

180
00:05:43,476 --> 00:05:45,376
跟我合作就像和朋友合作一样愉快
When you work with me, you're working with a friend.

181
00:05:45,376 --> 00:05:47,356
你真体贴 我很喜欢你
That is so sweet. I like you.

182
00:05:47,356 --> 00:05:49,386
别让我失望 别到最后逼我炒了你
God, I hope I don't have to fire you.

183
00:05:57,007 --> 00:05:58,647
你好 我是克莱尔 请留言
Hi. This is Claire. Leave a message.

184
00:05:59,497 --> 00:06:00,137
亲爱的 是我
Hey, honey. It's me.

185
00:06:00,137 --> 00:06:01,457
我刚开完会
I just finished the meeting,

186
00:06:01,467 --> 00:06:02,977
她简直是完美客户
and she is the perfect client.

187
00:06:03,437 --> 00:06:04,837
对价格不怎么计较
Realistic about the price...

188
00:06:04,837 --> 00:06:07,277
只想尽快把房子卖出去 她个性也很率真
she wants to sell fast, and she's a real character.

189
00:06:07,277 --> 00:06:08,487
你真应该见见她
You got to...meet her.

190
00:06:14,248 --> 00:06:17,018
不过她就快搬走了 我看还是算了吧
But she's moving soon, so what's the point?

191
00:06:21,518 --> 00:06:22,848
你加班加到真晚
Wow, you worked late.

192
00:06:22,848 --> 00:06:24,998
是啊 难熬的一天 我只想马上坐下歇歇
Yes. Brutal day. I just want to sit.

193
00:06:24,998 --> 00:06:26,539
正好 莉莉睡着了
Perfect. Lily's asleep.

194
00:06:26,539 --> 00:06:27,849
贝瑞待会跟咱们一起泡热水浴
Barry's meeting us in the hot tub.

195
00:06:27,849 --> 00:06:28,719
要是你压力太大
If you're feeling stressed,

196
00:06:28,719 --> 00:06:29,389
他可以给你灵气按摩一下
he could give you a treatment.

197
00:06:29,389 --> 00:06:30,209
我看还是算了吧
Ah, that's all right.

198
00:06:30,209 --> 00:06:32,079
我明天约了赤脚医生
I have an appointment with Dr. Bigfoot tomorrow.

199
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:33,609
好了好了 又来了
Okay. Here comes the judge.

200
00:06:34,309 --> 00:06:35,909
灵气按摩什么的都是骗人的 小卡
Reiki is a bunch of nonsense, Cam.

201
00:06:35,909 --> 00:06:36,909
那人就是个疯子
That guy is a nut.

202
00:06:36,939 --> 00:06:38,109
你每次都这样
You do this every time.

203
00:06:38,139 --> 00:06:39,139
每当我们结识一个新朋友
We meet a new friend,

204
00:06:39,179 --> 00:06:40,109
只要他们说出一件你不喜欢的事
they say one thing you don't like,

205
00:06:40,149 --> 00:06:41,080
你就会无情的把他们踢出局
and you just write 'em off.

206
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:42,220
我哪有
I do not!

207
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:43,810
没有吗 你忘了那个"但是可是雷切尔"了
Oh, really? What about "but yet Rachel"?

208
00:06:43,810 --> 00:06:46,260
我很想去 但是可是 我不怎么喜欢逛公园
"I'd love to go, but yet, I don't feel like parking".

209
00:06:46,290 --> 00:06:47,490
要不就说"但是" 要不就说"可是"
It's either "but" or "yet",

210
00:06:47,490 --> 00:06:47,970
没有放在一块说的
not both.

211
00:06:47,970 --> 00:06:49,420
你该庆幸到目前为止还没人来教训你
You're lucky no one's kicked your butt yet.

212
00:06:49,420 --> 00:06:50,650
那托马斯又怎么说
What about Thomas?

213
00:06:50,650 --> 00:06:51,880
你把他踢出局就是因为
You wrote him off because

214
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,250
他先上主菜 后上沙拉
he serves the salad after the meal,

215
00:06:53,290 --> 00:06:55,460
顺便说一句 这在欧洲是很正常的
which, by the way, is very common in Europe.

216
00:06:55,490 --> 00:06:57,491
他是从欧洲哪来的 自命不凡斯坦国吗
What part of Europe is he from? Pretentious-stan?

217
00:06:57,491 --> 00:06:58,231
好吧
Okay, fine.

218
00:06:58,231 --> 00:06:59,871
继续指责吧 别交任何朋友
Keep judging. Don't let anyone in.

219
00:06:59,871 --> 00:07:01,071
我也可以少管点
I could care less.

220
00:07:01,111 --> 00:07:02,161
你是想说你才懒得管呢吧
I think you mean you couldn't care less,

221
00:07:02,161 --> 00:07:03,251
因为你要说"可以少管点"
because if you could care less,

222
00:07:03,261 --> 00:07:04,111
就证明你还是管了
that means that you care a little bit.

223
00:07:04,111 --> 00:07:05,341
好吧 我要去泡热水浴了
All right. I'm going to the hot tub.

224
00:07:05,371 --> 00:07:06,511
要是我在这里多待一分钟
If I stay in here one more minute,

225
00:07:06,541 --> 00:07:08,181
我的头就真的要爆了
my head is literally gonna explode.

226
00:07:08,181 --> 00:07:09,551
我希望不会 因为要是真的会爆的话
Well, I hope not, because if you mean "literally" --

227
00:07:09,581 --> 00:07:11,622
我待在自己家里都没有安全感
I don't feel safe in my own home!

228
00:07:14,562 --> 00:07:15,992
菲尔 亲爱的 帮我一把
Phil, honey, I need your help.

229
00:07:15,992 --> 00:07:16,762
帮你干吗
With what?

230
00:07:16,862 --> 00:07:19,702
什么东西是违章超速者无法躲开的
What is the one thing a speeder can't outrun?

231
00:07:19,732 --> 00:07:22,142
子弹 激光
Ooh. Bullets. A laser.

232
00:07:22,142 --> 00:07:24,272
我知道了 大炮 老爸 快帮我想想
Oh, I know -- a falcon! Dad, jump in.

233
00:07:24,312 --> 00:07:25,242
时机不对
Not a good time.

234
00:07:25,242 --> 00:07:26,703
-雷射炮 -这个给力
- A laser falcon! - That's awesome.

235
00:07:26,743 --> 00:07:29,413
答案是 羞愧感
Shame.

236
00:07:30,513 --> 00:07:33,313
"使你的邻居们变得迟钝"
"Slow down your neighbors"!?

237
00:07:33,343 --> 00:07:35,353
不是这个意思 "放慢速度"
No. "Slow down" --

238
00:07:35,383 --> 00:07:36,923
是对违章超速者说的
talking to the speeder --

239
00:07:36,923 --> 00:07:38,453
是谁要对那违章超速者说呢
Who's talking to the speeder?

240
00:07:38,483 --> 00:07:39,483
你的邻居们
Your neighbors.

241
00:07:39,523 --> 00:07:40,723
才不是这个意思呢
It doesn't say that.

242
00:07:40,753 --> 00:07:43,104
没错 那上面只写着"使你的邻居们变得迟钝"
Yeah, it just says "Slow down your neighbors"!

243
00:07:43,104 --> 00:07:44,824
-菲尔 -我懂你想表达什么
- Phil. - I know what you were going for,

244
00:07:44,824 --> 00:07:46,594
可你那标牌上写的就是"使你的邻居们变得迟钝"
but now all I can see is "slow down your neighbors"!

245
00:07:46,624 --> 00:07:49,204
你们都错了 因为这再清楚不过了
Well, you're all wrong, 'cause this is incredibly clear.

246
00:07:49,204 --> 00:07:50,464
而且这很重要
And it's really important.

247
00:07:50,464 --> 00:07:52,574
我们需要在街区贴满这些告示
We need to put these signs up all over the neighborhood.

248
00:07:52,574 --> 00:07:54,224
这可不像你啊 这是胆小鬼做的事
I don't know. It seems kind of cowardly.

249
00:07:54,474 --> 00:07:56,835
为什么不直接打匿名电话给警方呢
Why don't you just make an anonymous call to the police?

250
00:07:56,875 --> 00:07:59,345
我老早打过了 可他们什么忙都帮不上
I called the police, and they were totally unhelpful.

251
00:07:59,375 --> 00:08:00,915
我早就说啦
Surprise. Surprise.

252
00:08:00,915 --> 00:08:02,375
菲尔 你到底站不站在我这边
Phil, come on. Are you with me or not?

253
00:08:02,375 --> 00:08:03,255
我当然站在你这边
Of course I'm with you.

254
00:08:03,255 --> 00:08:04,885
不然呢 难道站在那人这边
Who else would I be with? This guy?

255
00:08:04,915 --> 00:08:06,315
我和那人又没有任何瓜葛
I have no connection to this guy.

256
00:08:06,345 --> 00:08:07,445
-很好 帮我把它贴出去 -不
- Good! - No!

257
00:08:08,555 --> 00:08:10,115
好吧
Fine.

258
00:08:10,155 --> 00:08:11,486
在你炮轰我之前 我要说
Before you judge me,

259
00:08:11,526 --> 00:08:13,556
我已经整整七个季度
I have come in second to Gil Thorpe

260
00:08:13,586 --> 00:08:16,396
都在季度最佳销售员的评比上输给盖尔·索普而位居第二
for salesman of the quarter seven quarters in a row.

261
00:08:16,426 --> 00:08:17,756
整整七个季度
Seven.

262
00:08:18,356 --> 00:08:19,826
没人会记得第二名是谁
Nobody remembers second best.

263
00:08:19,856 --> 00:08:22,056
人人都爱迈克尔·乔丹
Oh, yeah, everybody loves Michael Jordan,

264
00:08:22,096 --> 00:08:24,056
可有谁会想起斯科蒂·皮蓬
but nobody thinks of Scottie Pippen.

265
00:08:24,096 --> 00:08:25,826
我会记得他的唯一原因是
The only reason I remember him

266
00:08:25,866 --> 00:08:28,627
他跟我最爱的音乐剧同名
is because he's named after my favorite musical.

267
00:08:30,837 --> 00:08:33,037
-米奇 -是贝瑞啊
- Oh, hey, Mitch. - Hey. It's Barry.

268
00:08:33,067 --> 00:08:33,747
我只是来通知你们
Uh, I just want to let you guys know

269
00:08:33,747 --> 00:08:35,677
你们有一个自动洒水器在漏水
you got a sprinkler head that's leaking out there.

270
00:08:35,677 --> 00:08:37,637
谢谢你 贝瑞 我会通知园丁的
Oh. Thanks, Barry. I'll let the gardener know.

271
00:08:37,677 --> 00:08:40,257
好的 又或者我可以朝它舞动一下我的双手
All right. Or maybe I could just wave my hands over it

272
00:08:40,257 --> 00:08:41,648
用我的灵气修好它
and heal it that way.

273
00:08:42,878 --> 00:08:44,178
只是玩笑
I'm joking.

274
00:08:45,888 --> 00:08:47,718
天呐 差点被你骗到
Oh, god. That was a good one.

275
00:08:47,748 --> 00:08:48,748
听着 不用担心
Look, don't worry about it.

276
00:08:48,788 --> 00:08:50,148
我看得出来 只要我一开始谈灵气
As soon as I started talking about reiki,

277
00:08:50,188 --> 00:08:52,088
你就觉得我的精神也许有点不太正常
I could tell you thought I might be a little nutty.

278
00:08:52,998 --> 00:08:54,418
有这么明显吗
Was I that obvious?

279
00:08:54,418 --> 00:08:55,748
你整天都冲我翻白眼
You roll your eyes a lot.

280
00:08:57,019 --> 00:08:58,249
给你说中了
Uh, no, it's true.

281
00:08:58,289 --> 00:08:59,419
我的确爱翻白眼
It's true, no.

282
00:08:59,459 --> 00:09:00,549
我曾经看到一张自己
I-I once saw a picture of myself

283
00:09:00,549 --> 00:09:02,189
在朋友的诵诗比赛上拍的照片
at a friend's poetry slam,

284
00:09:02,229 --> 00:09:04,089
结果照片里能看到的只有我的眼白
and all you could see were the whites of my eyes.

285
00:09:05,429 --> 00:09:06,969
我看上去就像孤女安妮
Yeah, I looked like Little Orphan Annie.

286
00:09:07,969 --> 00:09:09,069
那部动画片
The cartoon.

287
00:09:09,109 --> 00:09:10,909
总而言之 如有冒犯之处我很抱歉
Anyway, I'm sorry if I offended you.

288
00:09:10,939 --> 00:09:11,970
别 不用道歉
No. Don't apologize.

289
00:09:12,010 --> 00:09:14,590
唯一会让我觉得有所冒犯的事
Look, I -- only thing that offends me

290
00:09:14,590 --> 00:09:16,720
就是一个不能无法面对真实的自己的人
is a man who doesn't live in his own truth.

291
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:18,840
而且我知道你现在正很努力地
And I appreciate how hard you're trying

292
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,200
不去翻白眼 我为此表示感谢
not to roll your eyes right now.

293
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,900
因为我就快晕过去了
'Cause I'm about to pass out!

294
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:22,830
我看出来了
I see it.

295
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:26,130
我准备好了
Okay! I'm ready!

296
00:09:29,041 --> 00:09:30,571
他穿了些什么东西
What the hell's he wearing?

297
00:09:30,971 --> 00:09:32,701
保护软垫 还得再加点吗
Protection pads. He needs more?

298
00:09:32,741 --> 00:09:35,311
我们只是学骑车而已 又不是训练警犬
We're riding bikes. We're not training police dogs.

299
00:09:35,341 --> 00:09:37,111
好了 孩子 过来 上来吧
All right, kid. Come on. Get on.

300
00:09:38,191 --> 00:09:39,391
上车
On board.

301
00:09:40,471 --> 00:09:41,482
好样的
Attaboy.

302
00:09:41,482 --> 00:09:42,712
好了 准备好了吗
All right, we ready?

303
00:09:42,752 --> 00:09:44,112
骑
Ride!

304
00:09:44,152 --> 00:09:45,612
小心点 小乖乖
Be careful, papi.

305
00:09:45,652 --> 00:09:46,822
别理她
Ignore her.

306
00:09:46,852 --> 00:09:48,092
那孩子连在机场的
I've seen the kid fall down

307
00:09:48,092 --> 00:09:49,632
自动人行道上都能摔跤
on that moving sidewalk at the airport,

308
00:09:49,632 --> 00:09:50,962
所以我没抱太大希望
so I didn't have high hopes.

309
00:09:53,902 --> 00:09:56,382
可谁能会到呢 那孩子天生是个骑车的料
But what do you know? The kid was a natural.

310
00:09:56,603 --> 00:09:58,673
妈妈 这太简单了
Mom! It's so easy!

311
00:09:58,713 --> 00:09:59,673
太棒了 曼尼
Bravo, Manny!

312
00:09:59,713 --> 00:10:00,673
我就跟你说嘛
I told you!

313
00:10:00,713 --> 00:10:02,643
小心地上的坑
Be careful with the bump!

314
00:10:02,683 --> 00:10:04,383
等等 那人是谁
Hey, wait a minute. Who's that guy?

315
00:10:04,413 --> 00:10:05,743
杰 他会抓走曼尼的
Jay, he's gonna grab him!

316
00:10:05,783 --> 00:10:07,953
没人会被抓走 那只是个邻居而已
Oh, no one's grabbing anyone. It's a neighbor.

317
00:10:07,983 --> 00:10:09,553
可歌洛莉亚
Gloria, on the other hand,

318
00:10:09,583 --> 00:10:11,323
简直是个天生的悲剧
was a natural disaster.

319
00:10:11,353 --> 00:10:13,854
在骑车之前你要先做三件事
There are three things you want to do before you ride.

320
00:10:13,894 --> 00:10:14,924
曼尼说
Manny.

321
00:10:14,964 --> 00:10:17,194
检查鞋带 调整后视镜
Check your shoelaces, adjust your mirror,

322
00:10:17,224 --> 00:10:18,264
还有测试车铃
and test your bell.

323
00:10:18,294 --> 00:10:19,814
好的 鞋带系好了
Okay. Shoelaces tied...

324
00:10:20,414 --> 00:10:21,514
后视镜视野不错
the mirror is good...

325
00:10:22,944 --> 00:10:24,214
车铃也很正常
...the bell is ringing.

326
00:10:24,244 --> 00:10:25,284
好了 然后呢
Okay, now what?

327
00:10:25,314 --> 00:10:26,024
骑啊
Ride.

328
00:10:26,024 --> 00:10:27,065
别别别 杰
Ay, no, no, no, Jay.

329
00:10:27,095 --> 00:10:28,635
别推我 我可不想受伤
Don't push me! I don't want to get hurt!

330
00:10:28,695 --> 00:10:30,095
相信我 不会让你受伤的
Trust me. I'm not gonna hurt you.

331
00:10:30,135 --> 00:10:31,235
你就像一幅名画
You're a work of art.

332
00:10:31,265 --> 00:10:32,035
要是被划伤
If you get scratched,

333
00:10:32,035 --> 00:10:33,065
那可就掉价了
the value goes down.

334
00:10:33,065 --> 00:10:34,565
我是为了缓和气氛搞笑一下
I'm making a joke to lighten the mood.

335
00:10:34,605 --> 00:10:35,705
一点都不好笑
It's not working!

336
00:10:35,735 --> 00:10:37,075
你就骑吧
Let's just do this.

337
00:10:37,915 --> 00:10:39,585
好吧
Okay.

338
00:10:39,625 --> 00:10:41,325
慢点
Slowly.

339
00:10:41,355 --> 00:10:43,056
杰 慢点啊
Jay, slowly.

340
00:10:43,086 --> 00:10:44,526
放松 你摔不了
Relax. You're not gonna fall.

341
00:10:44,556 --> 00:10:46,396
我抓着你呢 把脚放在踏板上
I got you. Put your feet on the pedals.

342
00:10:46,426 --> 00:10:47,336
眼睛看着路
Now look where you're going.

343
00:10:47,336 --> 00:10:48,436
看着路啊
Look where you're going!

344
00:10:48,466 --> 00:10:49,386
不 我要摔了 我要摔了
No, I'm falling. I'm falling.

345
00:10:49,386 --> 00:10:50,386
目视前方 去吧去吧
Look straight ahead. Go, go, go.

346
00:10:50,416 --> 00:10:51,686
-踩踏板 -不要 杰
- Pedal! - No, Jay!

347
00:10:51,716 --> 00:10:53,486
你一个劲儿按铃干吗
What are you ringing the bell for?

348
00:10:53,516 --> 00:10:55,156
你怎么能放手呢 杰
Ay! Why you let me go, Jay?!

349
00:10:55,186 --> 00:10:56,526
不对不对 踩踏板
No, no! Pedal!

350
00:10:56,556 --> 00:10:58,257
目视前方 看着路
Look where you're going! Look where you're going!

351
00:10:59,757 --> 00:11:01,777
我要宰了你 杰
I'm gonna kill you, Jay!

352
00:11:01,777 --> 00:11:03,607
好了 今天学得不错
Okay. Good day's work.

353
00:11:03,647 --> 00:11:06,577
我们去珠宝店逛逛怎么样
What do you say we hit the jewelry store?

354
00:11:12,688 --> 00:11:14,288
菲尔
Phil?

355
00:11:14,318 --> 00:11:15,988
劳拉
Laura!

356
00:11:16,028 --> 00:11:17,628
你在干吗
What are you doing?

357
00:11:17,658 --> 00:11:20,428
把这个告示牌 拆下来
Taking this...sign down!

358
00:11:20,428 --> 00:11:22,788
我发现上面写着你的车牌号
I recognized your license plate.

359
00:11:22,828 --> 00:11:24,258
这也太荒唐了
This is ridiculous!

360
00:11:24,288 --> 00:11:26,328
我知道 整个小区都贴满了告示牌
I know. They're all over the neighborhood.

361
00:11:26,358 --> 00:11:28,799
什么疯子会干这种蠢事
What kind of lunatic does something like this?

362
00:11:28,829 --> 00:11:29,869
谁知道呀
Who knows?

363
00:11:29,899 --> 00:11:31,769
也许是某个无所事事的家庭主妇
It's probably some bored housewife

364
00:11:31,799 --> 00:11:33,399
对丈夫无爱 对生活怨恨
who hates her husband and hates her life,

365
00:11:33,439 --> 00:11:35,559
于是就把气撒在其他人身上
so she takes it out on the rest of us!

366
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:37,329
要么就是家里太平无事
Or things are so good at home,

367
00:11:37,359 --> 00:11:38,759
所以她就出门来找茬
she's out looking for problems.

368
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:39,829
相信我
Trust me.

369
00:11:39,869 --> 00:11:42,000
这种女人绝对是欲求不满
This woman needs to get laid.

370
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:43,670
我觉得不是这个原因
I don't think that's the issue.

371
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:45,900
拿着 把这个贴上
Here. Stick this up.

372
00:11:45,940 --> 00:11:48,170
这是老娘留给她的口信
Send her a message from me.

373
00:11:48,210 --> 00:11:50,540
好的
Okay.

374
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:55,870
天啊
Oh, my gosh.

375
00:11:55,900 --> 00:11:57,171
我的告示牌怎么成这样了
What happened to my sign?

376
00:11:57,201 --> 00:11:58,171
不知道啊
I don't know!

377
00:11:58,241 --> 00:11:59,701
我把它钉好后就走开了
I put it up, I went away,

378
00:11:59,741 --> 00:12:02,171
等我回来时 就已经成两半了
I came back -- it was in pieces!

379
00:12:02,211 --> 00:12:03,941
这也太疯狂了
This is so crazy.

380
00:12:03,981 --> 00:12:04,941
是疯狂啊
Crazy!!

381
00:12:04,981 --> 00:12:06,541
克莱尔 这件事本身就是疯狂的
Claire, this whole thing is crazy.

382
00:12:06,581 --> 00:12:09,351
也许我们应该作出点让步
Maybe we should back off a little bit.

383
00:12:09,381 --> 00:12:11,181
菲尔 绝不
You know what, Phil? No.

384
00:12:11,211 --> 00:12:12,782
我才不让步
I am not gonna back off.

385
00:12:12,822 --> 00:12:16,292
知道吗 我这么做是为了咱们街区居民的安全
Okay? I am doing this for the safety of our neighborhood.

386
00:12:27,563 --> 00:12:29,503
这是怎么回事啊
Well, what's going on here?

387
00:12:29,533 --> 00:12:30,473
小卡
Hey, Cam.

388
00:12:30,503 --> 00:12:32,333
我正在用内功清除他体内的负面能量
Just getting rid of some negative energy.

389
00:12:32,373 --> 00:12:34,573
估计你得清到周二 等你清完我们再回来
Oh, well, in that case, we'll be back Tuesday.

390
00:12:34,603 --> 00:12:36,573
米奇 你已经没事了
You're all set, Mitch.

391
00:12:37,813 --> 00:12:39,373
贝瑞
Barry.

392
00:12:39,413 --> 00:12:41,483
-伙计 感觉真舒服啊 -是吧
- Oh, man, that was -- that was great. - Yeah?

393
00:12:42,544 --> 00:12:43,484
别忘了合十礼 伙计
Namaste, man.

394
00:12:43,514 --> 00:12:45,184
-阿弥陀佛 -阿弥陀佛
- Namaste. - Namaste.

395
00:12:45,214 --> 00:12:46,984
好了 我不打扰你们了
All right. I'm gonna get out of your hair.

396
00:12:47,024 --> 00:12:48,694
我去洗个快澡
I'm gonna grab a quick tub

397
00:12:48,694 --> 00:12:50,764
再看看能不能弄点吃的
and see if I can rustle up some food.

398
00:12:50,804 --> 00:12:51,904
不 别弄了
Oh, no. Hey, don't rustle.

399
00:12:51,934 --> 00:12:53,664
我们今晚开伙 你过来一起吃吧
We're making dinner tonight. You're coming.

400
00:12:53,704 --> 00:12:54,774
是啊 来吧
Yeah, come down.

401
00:12:54,804 --> 00:12:56,074
-这样好吗 -当然了
- Yeah? - Yes.

402
00:12:56,104 --> 00:12:57,145
谢谢你 米奇
Thank you, Mitch.

403
00:12:57,175 --> 00:12:58,475
看见没 已经见效了
See? It's working already.

404
00:13:00,345 --> 00:13:01,275
阿弥陀佛
Namaste.

405
00:13:05,935 --> 00:13:06,795
你想说什么
What?

406
00:13:06,795 --> 00:13:07,995
你知道我要说什么
You know what I'm looking for.

407
00:13:08,035 --> 00:13:09,835
-他人很好 -不是这句
- He's a very nice guy. - That's not it.

408
00:13:09,865 --> 00:13:10,805
抱歉 我之前的判断有点仓促
I'm sorry I made a snap judgment.

409
00:13:10,835 --> 00:13:11,805
也不是这个哦
Still not it.

410
00:13:11,835 --> 00:13:12,876
你是对的
You were right.

411
00:13:12,906 --> 00:13:14,676
这就对了
There she is.

412
00:13:18,646 --> 00:13:19,776
米奇尔 你好
Hello, Mitchell.

413
00:13:19,816 --> 00:13:21,816
高太太 我是卡梅隆
Oh. Mrs. Ko. I'm Cameron.

414
00:13:21,846 --> 00:13:23,186
米奇尔的娇妻
Mitchell's the other one.

415
00:13:23,216 --> 00:13:24,516
你来这有事吗
What are you doing here?

416
00:13:24,546 --> 00:13:26,716
我刚带人去看了楼上的公寓
I just finished showing the apartment upstairs.

417
00:13:26,756 --> 00:13:27,837
什么意思 那贝瑞呢
What do you mean? What about Barry?

418
00:13:27,837 --> 00:13:28,517
贝瑞是谁
Who's Barry?

419
00:13:28,557 --> 00:13:29,267
新来的房客
The new tenant.

420
00:13:29,267 --> 00:13:31,057
里面没人住 这是间空房
Nobody living up there. It's empty.

421
00:13:31,087 --> 00:13:33,657
-可是 -你要是看见楼上有人就打我电话
- But... - You see anybody up there, you call me.

422
00:13:34,727 --> 00:13:35,997
是我丈夫
My husband.

423
00:13:36,027 --> 00:13:37,397
我来了
I'm coming!

424
00:13:37,427 --> 00:13:40,797
你该庆幸法律不让你俩结婚
You two so lucky they don't let you get married.

425
00:13:58,259 --> 00:13:59,579
这不是我的问题
The problem wasn't me.

426
00:13:59,579 --> 00:14:01,479
都怪杰 他教得也太烂了
It was Jay. He's a very bad teacher.

427
00:14:01,519 --> 00:14:02,519
太霸道了
Very bossy.

428
00:14:02,549 --> 00:14:03,989
人家不喜欢那样嘛
I don't respond to that.

429
00:14:04,019 --> 00:14:06,779
我喜欢有绅士风度 关爱有加的人
I need somebody gentle, nurturing,

430
00:14:06,779 --> 00:14:08,019
要像女性一样温柔
like a woman.

431
00:14:09,839 --> 00:14:11,609
歌洛莉亚 你好吗
Hey. Gloria. What's up?

432
00:14:11,609 --> 00:14:13,570
你能教我骑自行车吗
Can you teach me how to ride a bike?

433
00:14:13,610 --> 00:14:14,610
你竟然不会骑车
You can't ride a bike?

434
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:15,910
惹人怜爱啊
I love that about you.

435
00:14:15,950 --> 00:14:17,910
我一直觉得你完美无缺呢
I was beginning to think you didn't have any flaws.

436
00:14:17,950 --> 00:14:19,280
听着 我很想教你
Listen, I wish I could,

437
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,320
不过我约人看房要迟到了
but I'm late for an open house.

438
00:14:21,650 --> 00:14:23,520
我可以教你
I could teach you.

439
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:25,290
-真的吗 -当然了
- Really? - Sure.

440
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,590
我可是单车帝
I'm a great bike rider.

441
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:28,521
我教过好多朋友呢
I've taught a bunch of my friends.

442
00:14:29,321 --> 00:14:31,291
我从没教过别人任何东西
I never taught anyone anything.

443
00:14:31,331 --> 00:14:34,261
但我被人放了鸽子 正闲得慌呢
But my playdate canceled, so I was wide open.

444
00:14:38,031 --> 00:14:39,231
贝瑞
Barry?

445
00:14:39,271 --> 00:14:40,701
在
Yep!

446
00:14:45,172 --> 00:14:46,842
是你啊 卡梅隆
Oh. Hey, Cameron.

447
00:14:46,872 --> 00:14:48,542
你在里面干吗
What are you doing in there?

448
00:14:48,582 --> 00:14:49,682
我只是整理一下
I'm just tidying up a little bit.

449
00:14:49,712 --> 00:14:50,842
怎么了
What's up?

450
00:14:50,882 --> 00:14:52,812
你住在我女儿的公主城堡里吗
Are you living in our daughter's princess castle?!

451
00:14:52,852 --> 00:14:53,982
什么
What?!

452
00:14:54,012 --> 00:14:55,252
少来了 别开玩笑了
No, don't be ridiculous.

453
00:14:55,282 --> 00:14:56,982
我住在这儿 兄弟
I'm living in here, man.

454
00:14:57,022 --> 00:14:58,323
只是睡在那里面
I'm sleeping in there.

455
00:14:58,353 --> 00:15:00,553
你说你刚搬到楼上
You said you had just moved in upstairs.

456
00:15:00,593 --> 00:15:02,053
不 我是说我刚搬过来
No, I said I just moved in.

457
00:15:02,963 --> 00:15:05,093
对不起 我以为这暗示了
I'm -- I'm sorry. I thought it was implied...

458
00:15:05,133 --> 00:15:06,433
暗示你住在玩具屋里
that you're living in a dollhouse?

459
00:15:06,463 --> 00:15:07,693
好了 咱别在大庭广众之下的说这个了
Okay. Let's not do this outside.

460
00:15:07,733 --> 00:15:08,693
好吗
All right?

461
00:15:08,733 --> 00:15:09,243
要不要到屋里去
You want to go inside

462
00:15:09,243 --> 00:15:10,173
以成人的方式讨论这个问题
and talk about this like two adults?

463
00:15:10,213 --> 00:15:11,173
好的 就这样吧
Yes. Let's do that.

464
00:15:11,213 --> 00:15:12,183
好
Great.

465
00:15:12,213 --> 00:15:13,344
不
No --

466
00:15:13,384 --> 00:15:15,204
-不是这间屋 -没关系 我刚打扫过
- No! - It's okay. I just cleaned up.

467
00:15:18,564 --> 00:15:19,724
快进来
Come on in.

468
00:15:21,594 --> 00:15:23,494
天哪 你还真住在这里面
Oh, my God! You are living in here!

469
00:15:24,704 --> 00:15:26,304
进来再说
Inside voices.

470
00:15:30,625 --> 00:15:31,785
贝瑞
Barry.

471
00:15:32,805 --> 00:15:34,175
你是不是无家可归
Are you homeless?

472
00:15:34,205 --> 00:15:36,005
无家可归
Homeless?

473
00:15:36,005 --> 00:15:37,735
你疯了吗
Are you insane?

474
00:15:37,735 --> 00:15:38,805
看看这里 你看
Look at this place.I mean...

475
00:15:40,025 --> 00:15:42,435
好吧 没想到我不得不说出这种话
Okay. I can't even believe I'm having to say this,

476
00:15:42,435 --> 00:15:45,236
不过 你不能住在这
but you can't -- you can't stay here.

477
00:15:45,266 --> 00:15:46,406
兄弟
Oh, boy.

478
00:15:46,436 --> 00:15:47,506
是不是因为
This is about the --

479
00:15:47,536 --> 00:15:48,706
我帮米奇尔做内功排毒那件事
the body work I did with Mitchell, isn't it?

480
00:15:48,736 --> 00:15:50,176
要是你因此觉得不爽的话
'Cause I would understand if that was...

481
00:15:50,206 --> 00:15:50,916
我可以理解
bothering you.

482
00:15:50,916 --> 00:15:53,146
不是 而是因为你居然住在小女孩的玩具屋里
No. You are living in a little girl's toy,

483
00:15:53,176 --> 00:15:54,646
所以你必须搬出去
and you have to move out.

484
00:15:54,676 --> 00:15:56,346
好吧 但这着实会让晚宴变的很尴尬
Okay, well, this is gonna make dinner really awkward.

485
00:15:56,376 --> 00:15:58,087
没有晚宴 晚宴取消了
There's no dinner! Dinner is off!

486
00:15:58,087 --> 00:15:59,657
明白了吗 快点 走吧
Okay? Now, come on. Let's go.

487
00:15:59,687 --> 00:16:02,317
不 不 不 别碰我 我不喜欢别人碰我
No, no, no. Don't touch me. I don't like to be touched.

488
00:16:02,357 --> 00:16:04,227
可你是个按摩师啊
You're a massage therapist.

489
00:16:04,257 --> 00:16:06,557
我是灵气大师 基本不需要触碰
I'm a reiki master. Very little touching.

490
00:16:06,597 --> 00:16:08,257
好吧 贝瑞 听我说
Okay, Barry. Listen to me.

491
00:16:08,297 --> 00:16:09,227
你说
Okay.

492
00:16:09,267 --> 00:16:10,497
你是个好人
You're a very nice man.

493
00:16:10,527 --> 00:16:12,127
我和米奇尔都很喜欢你
Mitchell and I like you very much.

494
00:16:12,167 --> 00:16:13,038
谢谢
Thank you.

495
00:16:13,068 --> 00:16:14,138
但我 不客气
But I'm -- you're welcome.

496
00:16:14,168 --> 00:16:16,268
我要抓着你的手
I'm going to take your hand...

497
00:16:16,308 --> 00:16:18,568
我就要抓
Yes, I am.

498
00:16:18,608 --> 00:16:20,908
别像盯野狼一样盯我看 我又不是犬科动物
Don't give me the coyote look. I'm not a canine.

499
00:16:20,938 --> 00:16:23,238
我们一起离开这里
We're gonna walk out of here together.

500
00:16:23,278 --> 00:16:24,858
没人会伤害你
Nobody's gonna hurt you.

501
00:16:24,858 --> 00:16:26,098
你这样做不会有好结果的
Oh, this is not gonna end very well.

502
00:16:26,128 --> 00:16:27,098
把手给我
Give me your hand.

503
00:16:35,569 --> 00:16:36,569
小卡
Cam?!

504
00:16:36,609 --> 00:16:38,679
米奇尔 快报警
Mitchell! Call 911!

505
00:16:38,709 --> 00:16:39,639
怎么了
What's happening?!

506
00:16:39,679 --> 00:16:40,679
贝瑞是个疯子
Barry's a nut!

507
00:16:40,709 --> 00:16:41,979
他一直住在莉莉的城堡里
He's been living in Lily's castle!

508
00:16:42,009 --> 00:16:42,880
什么
What?

509
00:16:42,910 --> 00:16:44,380
你好啊 米奇尔
Hey, Mitchell!

510
00:16:44,420 --> 00:16:46,280
上帝啊 我还以为他住在楼上呢
Oh, my god! I thought he was living upstairs!

511
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,580
快去报警就是了
Just call the police!

512
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:49,990
你想让我停下来把整件事讲给你听吗
Do you want me to stop and give you the whole story?!

513
00:16:50,020 --> 00:16:51,760
我从没 我从没说过我住楼上
I never -- I never said upstairs.

514
00:16:51,790 --> 00:16:52,920
米奇尔
Mitchell!

515
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:55,410
快报警 别掐我
Call 911! Stop pinching!

516
00:16:55,410 --> 00:16:56,950
好吧 顺便跟你说
Okay. And just for the record,

517
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:58,851
我是对的
I was right!

518
00:16:58,881 --> 00:17:01,251
我还是觉得你不应该对别人评头论足
I still don't think you should judge people!

519
00:17:01,291 --> 00:17:02,821
我说放开我
I said get off me!

520
00:17:02,851 --> 00:17:03,821
好吧 歌洛莉亚
Okay, Gloria.

521
00:17:03,861 --> 00:17:05,681
是什么让你害怕骑车
What scares you about riding a bike?

522
00:17:05,681 --> 00:17:07,891
失去控制然后跌倒
Losing control and falling down.

523
00:17:07,921 --> 00:17:09,291
很好 还有吗
Great. What else?

524
00:17:09,321 --> 00:17:10,961
怕有人把我抓走
Somebody grabbing me?

525
00:17:10,991 --> 00:17:12,992
真怪异的想法 还有吗
That's weird. What else?

526
00:17:13,022 --> 00:17:15,432
-看上去很傻 -好吧
- Looking foolish. - Okay.

527
00:17:15,462 --> 00:17:17,702
你看 你就是被这些消极的想法牵绊住了
See, all these bad thoughts are holding you back.

528
00:17:17,732 --> 00:17:20,532
那我们怎么才能摆脱那些消极的想法呢
So how do we get rid of these bad thoughts?

529
00:17:21,962 --> 00:17:22,972
把他们射出来
We shoot 'em out!

530
00:17:22,972 --> 00:17:24,242
不要 你敢
No, don't you dare!

531
00:17:24,272 --> 00:17:25,242
快骑
Ride!

532
00:17:25,272 --> 00:17:26,372
你敢
Don't you dare!

533
00:17:26,412 --> 00:17:27,973
-快骑 -卢克 快停下
- Ride! - Luke, stop it!

534
00:17:28,013 --> 00:17:29,083
-不要 -我说快骑
- No! - I said ride!

535
00:17:29,113 --> 00:17:30,213
不要 不要
No, no!

536
00:17:30,253 --> 00:17:31,853
-快骑 -我要找你妈告状
- Ride! - I'm gonna tell your mother!

537
00:17:31,883 --> 00:17:33,153
说什么 说你在骑车吗
What? That you're riding a bike?

538
00:17:33,183 --> 00:17:35,083
不是 是说你
No, that you're...

539
00:17:35,123 --> 00:17:36,553
太棒了 我会骑车了
Yes! I'm riding the bike!

540
00:17:38,223 --> 00:17:41,323
那是世界上最棒的感觉了
It was the greatest feeling in the world.

541
00:17:41,363 --> 00:17:42,393
卢克是对的
Luke was right.

542
00:17:42,423 --> 00:17:44,664
没有什么可害怕的
There was nothing to be afraid of.

543
00:17:54,844 --> 00:17:55,974
下车 下车
Get off the bike! Get off the bike!

544
00:17:55,974 --> 00:17:56,704
-把车给我 给我 -别抓我
- Give it to me! Give it to me! - Ay, don't grab me!

545
00:17:56,704 --> 00:17:58,435
不 不 不 别抓我
No, no! No, don't grab me!

546
00:17:58,435 --> 00:18:00,105
走开 走开 走开
Go, go, go, go, go! Go!

547
00:18:00,145 --> 00:18:01,975
鞋带 后视镜
Laces, mirror...

548
00:18:02,015 --> 00:18:03,245
车铃
bell.

549
00:18:03,275 --> 00:18:04,445
减速 你个混蛋
Slow down, jerk!

550
00:18:09,185 --> 00:18:11,985
感谢二位的光临 很高兴认识你们
Thanks so much for coming. It was great to meet you both.

551
00:18:12,015 --> 00:18:13,086
祝你们一切顺利
Have a good one!

552
00:18:15,156 --> 00:18:16,156
再见
See you later.

553
00:18:17,426 --> 00:18:18,496
进展怎么样
How's it going?

554
00:18:18,526 --> 00:18:19,696
很好 来了很多人
Hey, great. Lots of people.

555
00:18:19,726 --> 00:18:21,666
听着 我在想那些标志的事
Listen, I was thinking about those signs.

556
00:18:21,696 --> 00:18:22,696
使你的邻居们变得迟钝
"Slow down your neighbors"!

557
00:18:22,736 --> 00:18:23,796
事实上 我觉得那个标示的意思是
Oh, actually, I think they meant

558
00:18:23,836 --> 00:18:24,936
"减速" 是对你说的
"slow down" -- talking to you --

559
00:18:24,966 --> 00:18:26,066
谁说的呢 "你的邻居们"
Who's talking? "Your neighbors".

560
00:18:26,096 --> 00:18:27,236
随便了
Anyway...

561
00:18:27,266 --> 00:18:28,437
你觉不觉得
Yeah, um, you think maybe it's possible

562
00:18:28,467 --> 00:18:29,437
你在居民区
that you do drive a little too fast

563
00:18:29,467 --> 00:18:30,437
开得有点太快了
in a residential neighborhood

564
00:18:30,467 --> 00:18:32,407
这周围还有孩子 也许
with children present, maybe, or...

565
00:18:32,437 --> 00:18:33,977
菲尔 我很感谢你的关心
Oh, Phil, I appreciate your concern,

566
00:18:34,007 --> 00:18:35,047
但是问题不在我
but I am not the problem.

567
00:18:35,077 --> 00:18:36,047
而是那个写标示的疯婆子
It's the crazy sign lady

568
00:18:36,077 --> 00:18:37,447
她连个完整的句子都不会写
who can't put a sentence together --

569
00:18:37,477 --> 00:18:38,477
那才是你该解决的问题
that's your problem.

570
00:18:53,398 --> 00:18:55,468
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil? Honey?

571
00:18:55,498 --> 00:18:56,058
克莱尔
Claire?

572
00:18:56,058 --> 00:18:57,498
上帝啊
Ohh. God.

573
00:18:57,538 --> 00:18:59,229
我得喝点水
I had to get some water.

574
00:18:59,229 --> 00:19:01,759
我在追那个疯子
I was chasing that crazy maniac.

575
00:19:01,799 --> 00:19:03,499
差一点就追上了
I got so close.

576
00:19:03,529 --> 00:19:04,969
然后你就这么放弃了
And you just gave up?

577
00:19:04,999 --> 00:19:06,729
那可不是我所认识的克莱尔
That's not the Claire that I know.

578
00:19:06,769 --> 00:19:07,999
-快出去继续追呀 -真的假的
- Get back out there! - Really?

579
00:19:08,039 --> 00:19:08,809
当然了
Yeah!

580
00:19:08,809 --> 00:19:10,179
菲尔 我把手机落在药房了
Phil, I left my phone at the drugstore.

581
00:19:10,209 --> 00:19:11,309
-我一会儿就回来 -好的 待会见
- I'll be right back. - Okay, bye.

582
00:19:11,349 --> 00:19:13,340
你好 我是克莱尔·邓菲
Hey. Hi. I'm Claire Dunphy.

583
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:14,270
菲尔的妻子
I'm Phil's wife.

584
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:15,270
别拉着她说了
Let's not talk her ear off.

585
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:16,310
她该走了
She's got to go.

586
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:17,310
我是劳拉 很高兴认识你
I'm Laura. Nice to meet you.

587
00:19:17,340 --> 00:19:18,180
这房子真漂亮
Oh, beautiful house.

588
00:19:18,210 --> 00:19:19,350
谢谢
Thanks.

589
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:21,210
你会经过格林利夫吗
Hey, are you going by Greenleaf?

590
00:19:21,250 --> 00:19:22,320
会
Actually, yeah.

591
00:19:22,350 --> 00:19:23,650
我刚才骑车骑得太累了
I just overdid it on my bike,

592
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,120
现在没劲骑回去了
and I cannot get back on there.

593
00:19:25,150 --> 00:19:26,020
没问题 我载你一程
No problem. I'll give you a ride.

594
00:19:26,050 --> 00:19:27,650
这主意太糟了
That's a terrible idea.

595
00:19:27,690 --> 00:19:29,591
-为什么 -为什么
- Why? - Why?

596
00:19:29,621 --> 00:19:31,641
我这希望我是那种
I wish I were one of those people

597
00:19:31,641 --> 00:19:34,271
热爱双重身份所带来的刺激感的人
who thrives on the danger of leading a double life.

598
00:19:34,311 --> 00:19:35,981
就像是布鲁斯·韦恩
You know, Bruce Wayne,

599
00:19:35,981 --> 00:19:37,041
彼得·帕克
Peter Parker,

600
00:19:37,041 --> 00:19:37,941
汉娜·蒙塔那
Hannah Montana.

601
00:19:37,981 --> 00:19:40,911
那个主意 太糟了
That's a terrible...idea,

602
00:19:40,951 --> 00:19:43,752
因为你的自行车还在这呢
because your bike is here.

603
00:19:43,782 --> 00:19:46,662
你准备怎么办 就把车丢在这 那太失礼了
What are you gonna do? Leave it? That's rude!

604
00:19:46,662 --> 00:19:47,792
那随时过来拿就好了
Oh, just pick it up whenever.

605
00:19:47,822 --> 00:19:49,422
随时 什么是随时
Whenever?! What's "whenever"?

606
00:19:49,462 --> 00:19:50,992
那也太随意了
That's so open-ended.

607
00:19:51,032 --> 00:19:51,622
行了 别叫唤了
Oh, stop it.

608
00:19:51,622 --> 00:19:52,662
走吧 克莱尔 咱们走
Come on, Claire. Let's fly.

609
00:19:52,702 --> 00:19:54,362
我喜欢她这么活力四射
Ahh. I love her energy.

610
00:19:54,402 --> 00:19:56,162
我来啦
I'm coming!

611
00:20:00,933 --> 00:20:03,563
你为什么要搬走
So, why do you want to move?

612
00:20:03,603 --> 00:20:06,303
我想住在有门卫的大厦里
Ah, I want a high-rise with a doorman.

613
00:20:07,703 --> 00:20:09,733
再说 这个小区有点疯狂
Besides, this neighborhood is getting a little crazy.

614
00:20:09,773 --> 00:20:11,033
感同身受呀
Oh, tell me about it.

615
00:20:11,073 --> 00:20:12,273
有个疯子
There's this one whack job...

616
00:20:12,303 --> 00:20:13,574
不用再多说了
You know, don't say another word.

617
00:20:13,614 --> 00:20:15,244
我敢说我知道你要说的是谁
I bet I know exactly who you're thinking of.

618
00:20:28,324 --> 00:20:29,655
克莱尔气得要死
Claire was furious.

619
00:20:29,655 --> 00:20:31,355
她说我从各个角度都背叛了她
She said I betrayed her on every level.

620
00:20:31,385 --> 00:20:33,795
所以我打电话给花店
So, I called the florist,

621
00:20:33,825 --> 00:20:38,765
订了一打气球
and I have ordered one dozen mylar balloons.

622
00:20:38,795 --> 00:20:41,695
看你还能气多久 亲爱的
Good luck staying mad, honey.

623
00:20:43,385 --> 00:20:45,566
快点 是那个文明社会发明了字母表
Come on, which civilization invent the alphabet

624
00:20:45,566 --> 00:20:46,756
我不知道
I don't know.

625
00:20:46,756 --> 00:20:47,466
你知道的
Yes, you do.

626
00:20:47,466 --> 00:20:49,176
这个问题我们都复习了上百遍了
We've been over this a hundred times.

627
00:20:49,176 --> 00:20:52,216
老爸 让我来 我是个很厉害的老师
Allow me, dad. I'm a great teacher.

628
00:20:52,246 --> 00:20:54,546
谁发明了字母表
Who invented the alphabet?

629
00:20:54,586 --> 00:20:56,646
我 不 知 道
I...don't...know.

630
00:20:56,686 --> 00:20:58,356
卢克
Luke!

631
00:20:58,386 --> 00:20:59,517
我浑身都湿了 你干吗呀
I got soaked! What are you doing?!

632
00:20:59,557 --> 00:21:00,877
说呀 说呀
Say it! Say it!

633
00:21:00,877 --> 00:21:01,777
卢克 别闹了
Luke, that's enough!

634
00:21:01,777 --> 00:21:02,357
我的天呐
Oh, my god!

635
00:21:02,357 --> 00:21:03,877
我不知道 我不知道 我不知道
I don't know! I don't know! I don't know!

636
00:21:03,917 --> 00:21:05,817
是腓尼基人 是腓尼基人
The Phoenicians! The Phoenicians!

637
00:21:05,847 --> 00:21:08,317
答案 正确
That's...right.

638
00:21:08,347 --> 00:21:10,357
本年度最杰出的老师
Teacher of the year.

639
00:21:12,387 --> 00:21:14,158
我把她交给你了 兄弟
She's all yours, buddy.
